_average\";d:8.362;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:29;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"IN\";}}i:8;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/ds3ioEzMhugec5rw2HkMnReahAZ.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:112945;s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"The Hardy Boys\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:14:\"The Hardy Boys\";s:8:\"overview\";s:238:\"When Frank and Joe Hardy arrive in Bridgeport, they set out to uncover the truth behind the recent tragedy that has changed their lives. In doing so, they stumble upon something much more sinister - something only the Hardy Boys can stop.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/zO24XYR7pxsRHJJG9zzA5SRz48B.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:9648;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:7.8431;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2021-03-05\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:7.268;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:56;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"CA\";}}i:9;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:1274175;s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Adam Boys\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:9:\"Adam Boys\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.5343;s:6:\"gender\";i:2;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:6:\"Acting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";s:32:\"/lFLjXQG8XUWugDjAOCPRKxidQhS.jpg\";s:9:\"known_for\";a:3:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/5r52emjfcu5jqxDWgQrdAXN8FHp.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:126172;s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"Leprechaun: Origins\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:19:\"Leprechaun: Origins\";s:8:\"overview\";s:121:\"Two young couples backpacking through Ireland discover that one of Ireland\'s most famous legends is a terrifying reality.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/yyZ7folrZTqEJFD7wUuGf84CmPK.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:27;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:1.8582;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2014-08-22\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:4.38;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:271;}i:1;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/r8PmEnTrhMe6NtlOTApZ1ht8bAT.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:293553;s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Bloody Knuckles\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:15:\"Bloody Knuckles\";s:8:\"overview\";s:482:\"This deliriously offensive, gory horror-comedy features an underground comic book artist whose obscene caricature upsets a crime lord, who responds by cutting off the young man’s hand. The young man wallows in post-severed hand depression. Will criminality reign supreme? Will he live alone as a bitter one-handed man? Not if the slightly rotted hand, now alive and determined to exact revenge, teems up with his former body and a masked S&M gay superhero to rid the city of evil.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/1i67kMcsiBOUn8cKrugBvhhtr5p.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:27;i:1;i:35;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3504;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2014-07-27\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:3.571;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:7;}i:2;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/ro0tlgnsco4SwbdAgmscLkSlMSL.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:1622;s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Supernatural\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:12:\"Supernatural\";s:8:\"overview\";s:462:\"When they were boys, Sam and Dean Winchester lost their mother to a mysterious and demonic supernatural force. Subsequently, their father raised them to be soldiers. He taught them about the paranormal evil that lives in the dark corners and on the back roads of America ... and he taught them how to kill it. Now, the Winchester brothers crisscross the country in their \'67 Chevy Impala, battling every kind of supernatural threat they encounter along the way. \";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/8iixmfGx5EIFPdpNvB2JvI3VIqX.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:9648;i:2;i:10765;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:216.721;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2005-09-13\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:8.311;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:8507;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"US\";}}}}i:10;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/yQtiuJnkFGyCNBfiHjTFRibQYyZ.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:34740;s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Boys be...\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:10:\"Boys be...\";s:8:\"overview\";s:991:\"Boys Be... is a manga created and written by Masahiro Itabashi and illustrated by Hiroyuki Tamakoshi, which was in 2000 adapted into a 13 episode anime series by Hal Film Maker.\n\nThree different Boys Be... manga series were serialized by Kodansha in Shukan Shōnen Magazine. In 2009 Kodansha announced a fourth series, Boys Be... Next Season, starting in the November 2009 issue of Magazine Special. The second manga series is licensed in North America by Tokyopop.\n\nThe anime first aired on WOWOW in April-June 2000. It was licensed by The Right Stuf International. The first DVD volume of the series was released in North America on February 28, 2006. Comcast and several other cable providers have shown Boys Be On Demand in the United States through the Anime Network. This series was aired on AXN-Asia before it handed all anime broadcasting duties to ANIMAX Asia, and, unlike other AXN anime making it to ANIMAX, was never retained. It also aired on Spanish networks Jonu Media and K3.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/1L6bmOdmKvkwVFKJ6NFWqqNT2aJ.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"ja\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:16;i:1;i:35;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:3.258;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2000-04-11\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:5.6;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:5;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"JP\";}}i:11;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/AqxPqTbD77ioyBDdk39MEQq6vXL.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:234763;s:4:\"name\";s:36:\"The Boy\'s Word: Blood on the Asphalt\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:57:\"Слово пацана. Кровь на асфальте\";s:8:\"overview\";s:917:\"In the late 1980s, when “perestroika” was taking place in the USSR and the era of the Soviet Union was about to collapse, life became unstable and very different. The 1980s brought not only freedom, but also waves of crime on the city streets. While some young people began to ‘grow up’ on the streets, others found it difficult to find their place in this unpredictable reality. Andrey, lives with his mother and five-year-old sister. He studies at a music school and often encounters street teenagers who harass him. To protect himself, Andrey makes friends with one of these teenagers, Marat, who introduces him to gang life. Youth groups fight for every piece of territory; they defend their right to live the life, even breaking laws and promises. The only thing that matters to them is the vows they make to their gang members-brothers, with whom they confront the violence and fears of the adult world.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/fmJ2vVzaSAPvCqB79H70uMHSNr4.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"ru\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:80;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:6.8511;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2023-11-09\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:8.643;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:214;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"RU\";}}i:12;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/kgXhHyQVPbWrmE2hvjrnLsGZBMs.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:210318;s:4:\"name\";s:44:\"The Boys from Brazil: Rise of the Bolsonaros\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:44:\"The Boys from Brazil: Rise of the Bolsonaros\";s:8:\"overview\";s:131:\"The remarkable rise of one of the world’s most controversial leaders, Jair Bolsonaro, from obscurity to the presidency of Brazil.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/sZXernSnVWGhlrAhDUDtdg3fuZn.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:99;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:13.2304;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2022-09-05\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:5.4;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:4;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"US\";}}i:13;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:1