\";s:32:\"/2U91KS7t6HA1dI6YMiA6TpPRVqU.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:35;i:1;i:28;i:2;i:53;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:1.757;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2007-10-18\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:4.642;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:397;}i:2;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/2dUUilVLgcQ5mbWqgU6wvAuvQbV.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:12950;s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Código Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:14:\"Código Postal\";s:8:\"overview\";s:687:\"Código Postal is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa and aired in Mexico on the network canal de las estrellas. It debuted on May 22, 2006 and finished on February 23, 2007 with hopes of duplicating the popularity of Mexican telenovela Rebelde which ended on June 2, 2006. Código Postal was replaced with Lola...Érase una vez.\n\nThe serial takes place in Acapulco, a popular tourist destination in the state of Guerrero, Mexico. The series is set within an exclusive gated community where the bulk of the cast resides. Like many Mexican telenovelas the cast comprises young, attractive actors, and many of the plotlines revolve around suspense, heavy struggles, love and romance.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/qaG1Vt9ZeNw21BxfiQckoHur0Sq.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"es\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:18;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:13.4124;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2006-05-29\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.5;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:2;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"MX\";}}i:3;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:1403080;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Florence Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:15:\"Florence Postal\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.1034;s:6:\"gender\";i:0;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:7:\"Writing\";s:12:\"profile_path\";N;s:9:\"known_for\";a:2:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/ea9rdcxr7NZwI5MVCoF3x3VzWHq.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:42640;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"The Big Trail\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:13:\"The Big Trail\";s:8:\"overview\";s:240:\"Young scout Breck Coleman leads a wagon train along the dangerous trail to Oregon as he tries to get the affection of the beautiful pioneer Ruth Cameron and plans his revenge on the harsh scoundrels who murdered a friend of his in the past.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/mmKlxMlpvTRwJWs0x2nAhdhWOIv.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:37;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:1.0372;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1930-11-01\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.7;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:131;}i:1;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";N;s:2:\"id\";i:559784;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"The Big Trail\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:16:\"Die große Fahrt\";s:8:\"overview\";s:282:\"A large caravan of settlers attempt to cross the Oregon Trail. German-language version of The Big Trail (1930) with an alternate cast and co-director. Bill Coleman (named Breck Coleman in the U.S. version) leads settlers in covered wagons Westward, across the prairie and mountains.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/2eGQ6yY2GSRffLpIckCQIfxbnhl.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"de\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:37;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.2469;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1931-04-04\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:8;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:1;}}}i:4;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";N;s:2:\"id\";i:291702;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Postal Worker\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:13:\"Postal Worker\";s:8:\"overview\";s:942:\"A time bomb is ticking in a small regional postal facility and his name is Oren Starks (Brad Garrett). Oren fits the profile of a new breed of killers - postal workers who crack under pressure. Their brains short circuit and the paranoid delusions begin. Going Postal begins as famed psychologist Dr. Nicolas Brink (Richard Portnow) launches his controversial research study in order to create a \"psychological vaccine\" to defuse these human time bombs who seem to be going postal at an alarming rate. It is revealed that almost everyone at this post office is on the brink of insanity! There\'s a perverse love triangle involving Oren, Harry Cash (Rob Roy Fitzgerald) and the sexy survivor of another postal shootout, Tammy Skye (Grace Cavanaugh). Postmaster Calhoun (William Long, Jr.) is driving the staff nuts by constantly micro monitoring their bathroom breaks. Something has got to give and its not the timely delivery of the U.S. mail.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/AtRJlVvniN7uEwDSx9T1kzsm3VK.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:28;i:1;i:35;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:1.3994;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1998-10-21\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:4.5;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:6;}i:5;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:1547235;s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Paul Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:11:\"Paul Postal\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3018;s:6:\"gender\";i:0;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:8:\"Lighting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";N;s:9:\"known_for\";a:3:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/2ssWTSVklAEc98frZUQhgtGHx7s.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:157336;s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Interstellar\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:12:\"Interstellar\";s:8:\"overview\";s:198:\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:12;i:1;i:18;i:2;i:878;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:63.8141;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2014-11-05\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"vi