ан\";s:8:\"overview\";s:164:\"The plot is based on the story of the complex relationship between Peter Schmidt and Zinaida Rizberg, with whom he corresponded after a chance meeting on the train.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/whublbmtnWssufn4xHTUltkTGkf.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"ru\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:36;i:2;i:10749;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.2031;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1970-03-16\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:9;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:1;}i:13;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:2255391;s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Daniel Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:13:\"Daniel Postal\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.075;s:6:\"gender\";i:0;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:6:\"Acting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";N;s:9:\"known_for\";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/qOGmcUqVph0x0ARdcZbGN5XmesE.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:81044;s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Sunday Buddies\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:23:\"Les Copains du dimanche\";s:8:\"overview\";s:273:\"Casti and Trébois, two friends who are workers at the same factory, have developed a common passion for flying. They dream of starting an aviation club. In the meantime they spend all their Sundays restoring an old plane under the supervision of Raf, a former RAF pilot...\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:31:\"/H3NZGkoCwZJANUpc3KgBjlhCaN.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"fr\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:12;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.6164;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1957-07-01\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.2;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:8;}}}i:14;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:1996836;s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Clark Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:12:\"Clark Postal\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.0143;s:6:\"gender\";i:0;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:8:\"Lighting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";N;s:9:\"known_for\";a:3:{i