 Journeys Into Mystic Time: One Two Three\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:45:\"Four Journeys Into Mystic Time: One Two Three\";s:8:\"overview\";s:227:\"An abstract work featuring three dancers, the performers interact with large screens as well as each other. Included in Shirley Clarke’s Four Journeys Into Mystic Time, costuming and color play an integral role in this piece.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/mCg2S45xkihfhwM35iZD6XnPvIv.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:14;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.0534;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1978-01-01\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:9;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:1;}}}i:15;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:5383125;s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Gloria Postal\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:13:\"Gloria Postal\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0;s:6:\"gender\";i:0;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:6:\"Acting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";N;s:9:\"known_for\";a:1:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/3kam5LdyDqIE8RHW1ZuW8Y0lyKe.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:716156;s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Ahead of the Curve\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:18:\"Ahead of the Curve\";s:8:\"overview\";s:449:\"With a fist full of credit cards, a lucky run at the horse track, and a title that called to mind a certain French film star, Franco Stevens launched the best-selling lesbian lifestyle magazine ever published, connecting her community in an unprecedented way. AHEAD OF THE CURVE is a new feature documentary about the extraordinary woman who started Curve magazine, and by doing so helped accelerate the political and social evolution of the nation.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/7teEp9imsGYIKC2vL65CIDZ1tWh.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:99;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.265;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2021-05-28\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:7.3;s: