tle\";s:13:\"Puss in Boots\";s:8:\"overview\";s:147:\"When the kittens of Puss in Boots are saved from drowning by a bagpiper, the cat offers to help the man rescue a princess as repayment of his debt.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/nsJ26gDQk5M7e0l6SGwC0SKHu9M.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:16;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3241;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1934-05-16\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:9;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:1;}i:15;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/p4U35A1w2JiW3egt0e7N9J9rVL8.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:151455;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Puss in Boots\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:24:\"Кот в сапогах\";s:8:\"overview\";s:388:\"The cat in the bag arrives in Russia as part of humanitarian aid from America and gets young drunk and mountain-the patriot Karabasov, which offers to emigrate to America. Flying on the magic cat which uses the tail as a propeller, dropped over Europe. There conceited young man forgets about the invaluable services rendered him puss in boots, and he returns ungrateful back to Russia...\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/1ApYiJDmkqOlrrr668QMJUItaQK.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"ru\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:16;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3699;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1995-01-01\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.583;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:24;}i:16;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/kViyEwBhSDalgogv712AnJgnQyy.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:694230;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Puss in boots\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:21:\"Der gestiefelte Kater\";s:8:\"overview\";s:587:\"When the old miller dies, he leaves the mill to the eldest son, the donkey to the second eldest and a tomcat to the youngest. The tomcat wants to repay his master\'s friendship and help him. He has his boots made, gains access to the royal castle and catches the partridges the king wants. He impersonates the miller\'s boy Hans as \"Count of the Mill\", tricks him into wearing elegant clothes and brings him together with the king and the princess. He succeeds in overcoming the evil sorcerer and winning a magnificent castle for Hans. Hans finally becomes king and his cat first minister.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/p3OESaFYvN7cdkuj5f5DYYVbw95.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"de\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:16;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3271;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1968-03-29\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:0;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:0;}i:17;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/2Mho26Ot1woZIU4m3142SG089J3.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:154480;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Puss in Boots\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:13:\"Puss in Boots\";s:8:\"overview\";s:405:\"A boy falls for a princess, his cat for hers. But her father does not like the idea of a commoner marrying a noblewoman and kicks him out. After seeing a Rudolpho Valensino movie at the local theater his cat has the idea that he could try impressing the king as bullfighter, to win his daughters hand. Bullfighting is relatively easy, when you can hypnotize the bull, but why does his cat need new boots ?\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/yMNCipJdwK29KnMhxSsNUZAmsCi.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:16;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.3958;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1922-11-03\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:5.167;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:18;}i:18;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";N;s:2:\"id\";i:305158;s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"New Puss in Boots\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:17:\"New Puss in Boots\";s:8:\"overview\";s:162:\"Known the world over as the most daring swashbuckler ladies man, and all around coolest cat, Puss In Boots shares advice, stories and tasty tidbits with his fans.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";N;s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:0:{}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.9293;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2014-05-02\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:0;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:0;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"US\";}}i:19;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:31:\"/SXoZJMX1uoJGEtBEN0TKjWFmP8.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:243013;s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Puss in Boots Shorts\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:20:\"Puss in Boots Shorts\";s:8:\"overview\";s:101:\"In Puss in Boots Shorts, the swashbuckling feline hero offers everyday advice to his legions of fans.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/rMpjhSHYPvtYHkm96Wr8DlBuLHq.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:0:{}s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.0629;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2014-05-02\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:0;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:0;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"US\";}}}s:11:\"total_pages\";i:3;s:13:\"total_results\";i:42;}',1783485356),('laravel-cache-tmdb_search_sinbad','a:4:{s:4:\"page\";i:1;s:7:\"results\";a:20:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/dPqhUynQ3HomdhwJVi33CaIwpbl.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:40187;s:4:\"name\";s:6:\"Sinbad\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:6:\"Sinbad\";s:8:\"overview\";s:640:\"Sinbad accidentally kills the son of the powerful Lord Akbari in a fist fight. As recompense for the blood debt, Sinbad\'s brother is killed in front of his eyes. Sinbad escapes, but his grandmother uses a magic talisman to curse him for the death of his brother. The curse prevents Sinbad from staying on land for more than one day; if he tarries the talisman will choke him to death. This prohibition against remaining on land leads to a life of adventure at sea that holds many wonders. Sinbad is unaware that he is still being hunted by Lord Akbari, who does not consider Sinbad\'s brother\'s death as sufficient payment of the blood debt.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/bhz6mMRybQnmoEycU3fCMIAtJbv.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:4:{i:0;i:10759;i:1;i:10765;i:2;i:18;i:3;i:10751;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:4.9072;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"2012-07-08\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:5.548;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:42;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"GB\";}}i:1;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/yP7AnSP0NSsheMDtgIwvGWA1QIF.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:1841;s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"The Adventures of Sinbad\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:24:\"The Adventures of Sinbad\";s:8:\"overview\";s:277:\"The Adventures of Sinbad is a Canadian television series which aired from 1996 to 1998. It follows on the story from the pilot of the same name, and revolves around the series\' protagonist, Sinbad. The series is a re-telling of the adventures of Sinbad from The Arabian Nights.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/dakx8dktuEWOZ28AmDtCiKOKxTF.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:10759;i:1;i:10765;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:7.7194;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"1996-09-28\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.9;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:52;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"CA\";}}i:2;a:10:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:57119;s:4:\"name\";s:6:\"Sinbad\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:6:\"Sinbad\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:6:\"person\";s:10:\"popularity\";d:0.876;s:6:\"gender\";i:2;s:20:\"known_for_department\";s:6:\"Acting\";s:12:\"profile_path\";s:32:\"/heuiXoUOWDvoeBd9VLKryt4C1rs.jpg\";s:9:\"known_for\";a:3:{i:0;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/rnn6sGMGPpM8VfVmCMFxsjKvz7q.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:9279;s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Jingle All the Way\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:18:\"Jingle All the Way\";s:8:\"overview\";s:462:\"Howard Langston, a salesman for a mattress company, is constantly kept busy at his job, disappointing his son. After he misses his son\'s karate exposition, Howard vows to make it up to him by buying an action figure of his son\'s favorite television hero for Christmas. Unfortunately for Howard, it is Christmas Eve, and every store is sold out of Turbo Man. Now, Howard must travel all over town and compete with everybody else to find a Turbo Man action figure.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/lHLOUt0ZIQLC5asHdIQBoTUvaEp.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:10751;i:1;i:12;i:2;i:35;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:4.1794;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1996-11-21\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.068;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:2963;}i:1;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/fnbWrDx8w8Reau4F1tFqoGuGmDZ.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:1426776;s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"STRAW\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:5:\"STRAW\";s:8:\"overview\";s:153:\"What will be her last straw? A devastatingly bad day pushes a hardworking single mother to the breaking point — and into a shocking act of desperation.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/t3cmnXYtxJb9vVL1ThvT2CWSe1n.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:3:{i:0;i:53;i:1;i:18;i:2;i:80;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:7.4767;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"2025-06-05\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:7.718;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:972;}i:2;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/rysvKeLogXYSGlx4XuH04ldr8mh.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:12559;s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"First Kid\";s:14:\"original_title\";s:9:\"First Kid\";s:8:\"overview\";s:920:\"Some say that to be the leader of a country is one of the loneliest jobs in the world. But being the child of a world leader can be doubly so. Constantly surrounded by security officers, restricted in movements and having almost every waking moment carefully monitored makes normalcy an impossibility. No one knows this better than young Luke Davenport, the son of U.S. President Davenport. He vents his loneliness, frustration and feelings of isolation from family and friends by being a brat to his private Secret Service agent. When the agent snaps from the strain in front of the First Lady, a new agent is assigned to Luke. He turns out to be the enormous Sam Simms, a bit of a rogue who managed to rise through the ranks by sheer determination rather than strict adherence to Secret-Service protocol. At first, Luke tries all his old tricks upon Sam. But instead of getting angry, Sam seems to actually understand.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";s:32:\"/t7yTkuXQpnougXmRIqgfT32axZi.jpg\";s:10:\"media_type\";s:5:\"movie\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:2:{i:0;i:35;i:1;i:10751;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:1.1916;s:12:\"release_date\";s:10:\"1996-08-30\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:5:\"video\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:5.8;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:205;}}}i:3;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";N;s:2:\"id\";i:2358;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"The Sinbad Show\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:15:\"The Sinbad Show\";s:8:\"overview\";s:314:\"The Sinbad Show is an American sitcom starring comedian Sinbad that premiered on September 16, 1993 on Fox. The show\'s main plot is about a bachelor taking in two orphaned children. Chuck Brown performed this sitcom\'s theme music. It was canceled after one season on April 21, 1994, with two episodes left unaired.\";s:11:\"poster_path\";N;s:10:\"media_type\";s:2:\"tv\";s:17:\"original_language\";s:2:\"en\";s:9:\"genre_ids\";a:1:{i:0;i:35;}s:10:\"popularity\";d:3.0866;s:14:\"first_air_date\";s:10:\"1993-09-16\";s:8:\"softcore\";b:0;s:12:\"vote_average\";d:6.5;s:10:\"vote_count\";i:2;s:14:\"origin_country\";a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"US\";}}i:4;a:16:{s:5:\"adult\";b:0;s:13:\"backdrop_path\";s:32:\"/kLx1IuDOeAK6MhNAD7lUPdkhw2G.jpg\";s:2:\"id\";i:66870;s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"Magi: Adventure of Sinbad\";s:13:\"original_name\";s:34:\"マギ シンドバッドの冒険\";s:8:\"overview\";s:259:\"Thirty years before the events of Magi, a brave and  handsome young man named Sinbad set sail and started his adventure. The  future High King of